 "remarks": "This lovely center hall colonial is too good to be true! Conveniently situated within walking distance to the train, shops and next to Baker Park! The spacious living room with fireplace and adjacent dining room are perfect for entertaining. Boasting an eat-in kitchen with marble countertops and stainless appliances. A beautiful French door leads to a large deck and a newly landscaped yard complete with an outdoor shower. Upstairs you'll find a primary suite offering updated bath, newly constructed his/her closets as well as ample built-ins, twi additional bedrooms and an updated bathroom. Natural light streams into a finished basement, offering an extra 429 sqft of living space. This energy efficient smart home is move-in ready!",
